"notes": "Annual workforce population statistics on the federal public service from March 2010 to March 2026 which includes the core public administration and separate agencies. The datasets included are: \r\n\r\n- Population of the federal public service\r\n    - by department or agency\r\n         - and by tenure\r\n         - and by province or territory of work\r\n         - and by age band\r\n         - and average age\r\n         - and by executive level\r\n         - and by first official language\r\n         - and by sex\r\n    - by province or territory of work and tenure\r\n    - by province or territory of work\r\n    - in the National Capital Region\r\n    - by tenure\r\n    - by first official language\r\n    - by age band", "notes_translated": {"en": "Annual workforce population statistics on the federal public service from March 2010 to March 2026 which includes the core public administration and separate agencies. The datasets included are: \r\n\r\n- Population of the federal public service\r\n    - by department or agency\r\n         - and by tenure\r\n         - and by province or territory of work\r\n         - and by age band\r\n         - and average age\r\n         - and by executive level\r\n         - and by first official language\r\n         - and by sex\r\n    - by province or territory of work and tenure\r\n    - by province or territory of work\r\n    - in the National Capital Region\r\n    - by tenure\r\n    - by first official language\r\n    - by age band", "fr": "Statistiques annuelles sur la population de la fonction publique f\u00e9d\u00e9rale de mars 2010 \u00e0 mars 2026 qui comprend l'administration publique centrale et les organismes distincts. Les ensembles de donn\u00e9es inclus sont : \r\n\r\n- Effectif de la fonction publique f\u00e9d\u00e9rale\r\n    - par minist\u00e8re ou organisme\r\n         - et par dur\u00e9e d\u2019emploi\r\n         - et par province ou territoire de travail\r\n         - et par cat\u00e9gorie d'\u